#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:59
msgid "The tax rate is a percentage of the **tax-excluded** subtotal."
msgstr ""
"Ставка податку є відсотком від **без урахування податку** проміжного "
"підсумку."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:61
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:112
msgid ""
"The exact tax computation depends on the :ref:`Included in Price <taxes/"
"included-in-price>` field, which determines whether the tax amount is "
"included in the sales price."
msgstr ""
"Точне обчислення податку залежить від поля :ref:`Включено в ціну <taxes/"
"included-in-price>`, яке визначає, чи включена сума податку в ціну продажу."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:65
#: ../../content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:116
