msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices` "
"and :ref:`create a new invoice <accounting/invoice/creation>`."
msgstr ""
"Перейдіть до :menuselection:`Облік --> Клієнти --> Рахунки` "
