"розділі :guilabel:`Account management`."

#: ../../content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:78
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`General` section, click the :icon:`fa-pencil` "
"(:guilabel:`Edit property`) icon next to the :guilabel:`Capture Delay` field."
msgstr ""
"У розділі :guilabel:`General` натисніть значок :icon:`fa-pencil` "
